go-cachekit

The SieveCache implementation is inspired by the SIEVE cache eviction
algorithm and the public MIT-licensed Go implementation at:

  https://github.com/guerinoni/sieve

SIEVE references:

  Yazhuo Zhang, Juncheng Yang, Yao Yue, Ymir Vigfusson, K. V. Rashmi.
  "SIEVE is Simpler than LRU: an Efficient Turn-Key Eviction Algorithm
  for Web Caches." NSDI 2024.

